<title>INDIA: India VSNL Q1 traffic volume up 25 pct.</title>
<headline>India VSNL Q1 traffic volume up 25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's overseas communications monopoly Videsh Sanchar Nigam Ltd (VSNL) said on Wednesday that it has got off to a strong start for 1997/98 (April-March).</p>
<p>&quot;First quarter trends show over 25 percent increase in traffic volumes over corresponding period in 1996/97,&quot; the state-run firm said in a statement.  </p>
<p>The traffic volume was up 4.5 percent compared to the quarter immediately preceding (January-March 1997), it said.</p>
<p>VSNL did not give details.</p>
<p>--Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
